---
import SectionLabel from './ui/SectionLabel.astro';
import Button from './ui/Button.astro';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden" id="pricing">
  <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-12 py-12 max-md:px-5 max-md:py-8">
    <SectionLabel>Стоимость</SectionLabel>
    <h2 class="rv text-[clamp(30px,4vw,50px)] font-semibold text-primary leading-tight mb-3.5 tracking-[--tracking-section]">
      Сколько стоит ничего не менять?
    </h2>
    <p class="rv text-[15px] text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-[620px]">
      Прежде чем смотреть на цену — посчитайте, сколько вы уже потратили на попытки разобраться самостоятельно.
    </p>

    <!-- Cost comparison -->
    <div class="rv grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-7 mb-8">
      <div class="rounded-[20px] p-7 bg-red-soft/[0.04] border border-red-soft/15">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-red-soft mb-4">❌ Путь «по кругу»</h4>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 border-b border-border text-[13px] text-gray-700"><span>Визиты к 3–4 врачам</span><span class="font-bold text-primary whitespace-nowrap ml-3">8 000+ ₽</span></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 border-b border-border text-[13px] text-gray-700"><span>Анализы, которые «в норме»</span><span class="font-bold text-primary whitespace-nowrap ml-3">5 000+ ₽</span></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 border-b border-border text-[13px] text-gray-700"><span>БАДы наугад (3–6 мес)</span><span class="font-bold text-primary whitespace-nowrap ml-3">10 000+ ₽</span></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 border-b border-border text-[13px] text-gray-700"><span>Диетолог / нутрициолог разово</span><span class="font-bold text-primary whitespace-nowrap ml-3">4 000+ ₽</span></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 text-[13px] text-gray-700"><span>Потерянная энергия и отношения</span><span class="font-bold text-primary whitespace-nowrap ml-3">∞</span></div>
        <div class="mt-3.5 pt-3.5 border-t-2 border-border-md flex justify-between text-[15px] font-extrabold text-primary"><span>Итого за год</span><span>27 000+ ₽</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-[20px] p-7 bg-brand/[0.04] border border-brand/20">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-deep mb-4">✅ Программа «Сам себе нутрициолог»</h4>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 border-b border-border text-[13px] text-gray-700"><span>Системное понимание тела</span><span class="font-bold text-brand whitespace-nowrap ml-3">✓</span></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 border-b border-border text-[13px] text-gray-700"><span>Работа с причиной, не симптомами</span><span class="font-bold text-brand whitespace-nowrap ml-3">✓</span></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 border-b border-border text-[13px] text-gray-700"><span>Поддержка куратора 30 дней</span><span class="font-bold text-brand whitespace-nowrap ml-3">✓</span></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 border-b border-border text-[13px] text-gray-700"><span>6 бонусных модулей</span><span class="font-bold text-brand whitespace-nowrap ml-3">✓</span></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 text-[13px] text-gray-700"><span>Знания на всю жизнь</span><span class="font-bold text-brand whitespace-nowrap ml-3">✓</span></div>
        <div class="mt-3.5 pt-3.5 border-t-2 border-border-md flex justify-between text-[15px] font-extrabold text-primary">
          <span>Стоимость</span>
          <span><span class="line-through text-gray-400 text-[13px] font-medium">49 990 ₽</span>&nbsp; 29 990 ₽</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tariffs -->
    <h3 id="tariffs" class="rv text-[clamp(26px,3.5vw,42px)] font-semibold text-primary leading-tight mb-3.5 tracking-[--tracking-section]">Выберите свой формат</h3>

    <div class="rv grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4.5 mt-6">
      <!-- Self-guided -->
      <div class="bg-brand/14 border border-brand/15 rounded-3xl p-8.5 flex flex-col">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-gray-400 mb-3.5">Самостоятельный</div>
        <span class="inline-block bg-red-soft text-white text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full mb-2.5 tracking-[0.04em] self-start">−55%</span>
        <div class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-gray-400 line-through leading-none mb-1">43 990 ₽</div>
        <div class="text-[50px] font-extrabold text-primary leading-none mb-6.5">23 990 ₽</div>
        <ul class="list-none flex flex-col gap-2.5 mb-7 grow">
          <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-gray-700 leading-snug"><span class="text-brand font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>26 уроков в записи</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-gray-700 leading-snug"><span class="text-brand font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>Все практические материалы и чек-листы</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-gray-700 leading-snug"><span class="text-brand font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>Доступ к чату участников</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-gray-700 leading-snug"><span class="text-brand font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>Все 6 бонусных модулей</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-gray-700 leading-snug"><span class="text-brand font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>Доступ 5 месяцев</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="border-t border-border pt-6">
          <Button variant="primary" href="https://iandmyhealth.ru/kyrs/samnytri" target="_top" fullWidth>Выбрать тариф</Button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- With support (featured) -->
      <div class="bg-primary rounded-3xl p-8.5 relative flex flex-col">
        <div class="absolute -top-3.5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-brand text-primary text-[11px] font-bold px-4 py-1 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap tracking-[0.06em] uppercase">Рекомендуем</div>
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-white/45 mb-3.5">С поддержкой кураторов</div>
        <span class="inline-block bg-red-soft text-white text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full mb-2.5 tracking-[0.04em] self-start">−60%</span>
        <div class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-white/35 line-through leading-none mb-1">49 990 ₽</div>
        <div class="text-[50px] font-extrabold text-white leading-none mb-6.5">29 990 ₽</div>
        <ul class="list-none flex flex-col gap-2.5 mb-7 grow">
          <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-white/80 leading-snug"><span class="text-brand font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>26 уроков в записи</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-white/80 leading-snug"><span class="text-brand font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>Все практические материалы и чек-листы</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-white/80 leading-snug"><span class="text-brand font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>Поддержка куратора-нутрициолога каждый день</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-white/80 leading-snug"><span class="text-brand font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>Разбор вашей ситуации и симптомов</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-white/80 leading-snug"><span class="text-brand font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>Ежедневные отчёты с обратной связью</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-white/80 leading-snug"><span class="text-brand font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>Все 6 бонусных модулей</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-white/80 leading-snug"><span class="text-brand font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>Доступ 5 месяцев</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-6">
          <Button variant="brand" href="https://iandmyhealth.ru/kyrs/samnytr" target="_top" fullWidth>Записаться сейчас</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
